[[Image:Tanglefootbag.gif|right|Item icon]]
A '''tanglefoot bag''' is a grenade-like weapon packed with stringy strands that burst on impact to snare a target. The round, small leather bag is full to bursting with an alchemical goo. Once exposed to air, the goo becomes tough and resilient, able to [[entangle|hold]] a creature in place for up to 2 [[round]]s.

The target creature can avoid entanglement by passing a [[difficulty class|DC]] 15 [[reflex]] save.

